/// Contains the VPC and subnets for a proxy mode firewall endpoint. You use
/// it in CreateFirewall when NoSourcePreservation is TRUE , to specify
/// where Network Firewall creates the firewall endpoint. This differs from
/// VpcEndpointAssociation , which defines additional secondary endpoints
/// for a firewall in other VPCs.
